[For "white"]
[Kind "sideline"]
[Start "london-nc6 4.Nf3"]
[Name "2...Nc6: the pin with ...Bg4"]

4... Bg4 { Pins the knight to the queen. [%icon pin@f3] }
5. Nbd2 { Gives the f3 knight a second defender, so ...Bxf3 will not damage White's pawns. }
5... e6
6. h3 { Asks the bishop to take or to retreat. Either way, the pin is soon over. [%cal Gh3g4] }
6... Bh5
7. Be2 { Breaks the pin for good: the queen is no longer exposed, and White can castle next. } *
